AAC audio decoder for 9front
============================

Decodes AAC (ADTS) streams from stdin, writes s16 PCM to
stdout via pcmconv.  Intended for internet radio streams.

Requires FAAD2 (libfaad) source in the libfaad/
subdirectory.  See SETUP for instructions.

Usage:
	hget http://stream.example.com/aac | audio/aacdec | audio/pcmconv -o s16c2r48000 > /dev/audio

Building:
	mk

Installing:
	mk install
	(installs to /$objtype/bin/audio/aacdec)
